[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "意外も意外！\u3000アルビーナが粘る！\nノーヴァ神聖国期待の錬金術士だ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What a surprise! Alvina's holding her own! She's Nova's rising star alchemist!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術士対決！\u3000これはもはや、技の応酬だけでは\n収まりません！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "An alchemical duel! This has gone far beyond a mere exchange of techniques!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁっ……はぁ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hah... hah..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（アタシ、なかなかやれてるじゃん！\n\u3000これなら、もしかしたら）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I'm actually doing pretty well! Maybe I can actually...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここ最近の自信作、使っちゃうよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Time to use my latest masterpiece!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それじゃあ私も、これを使うね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then I'll use this too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "来た来た来たー！\u3000錬金術対決だー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Here it comes! An alchemy showdown!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "く……っ、でも、まだまだ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... but I'm not done yet...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこまで！\u3000これにて御前試合を終了する！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's enough! This concludes the exhibition match!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（やっぱり、及ばなかった……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I still couldn't match her...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふふ、なんたる楽しさ！\n他にまだ挑む者はいませんか！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heheheh, what fun! Are there any other challengers?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "千歳。だいぶ満足している様子だ。\n今ならいけないか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose. She seems quite satisfied now. Think you can handle it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……試してみます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I'll try."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "星の下に、祓え給い、星の子の行く先を、照らし給え",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "By the stars above, be purified. May the path of the star's child be illuminated."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "グオォ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Groooh..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "蛇神",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Serpent God"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わ、わ？\u3000やっと身体が自由に……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wh-what? I can finally move freely again...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "千歳、ご苦労だった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well done, Chitose."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんだかご迷惑をおかけしたようで……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It seems I caused quite a bit of trouble..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ！\u3000アルビーナの錬金術、すごかったよ！\n本当に腕を上げたね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh! Your alchemy was incredible, Alvina! You've really improved!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "へへ。修行の成果ってやつ？\nアルビちゃんの腕をしかと見たか！\u3000ってね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. That's what training does for you, right? Did you see what Alvie can do?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000私まで嬉しいよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I did! I'm so happy for you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（そうは言ってみたものの、アタシはまだまだだ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Even though I said that, I still have a long way to go.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（今のアタシじゃ、正面から挑んだって\n\u3000まだまだレスナには勝てない）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The way I am now, I still can't beat Resna in a head-on fight.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それで。こいつがレスナに取り憑いていたものの\n正体か",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So. This is the true form of what possessed Resna?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そのお姿……蛇神様でしたか。この地に祝福を\nもたらすはずのあなた様が、どうしてこのようなことを",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That appearance... So it was the Serpent God. Why would you, who should bring blessings to this land, do such a thing?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……満足していないからだ。\n我には今、力が有り余っておる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Because I am not satisfied. I have far too much power right now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "蛇神",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Serpent God"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あの社には十二神が宿っており、１年ごとに１柱が\n祝福をもたらす取り決めになっているのだが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Twelve gods dwell in that shrine, and we take turns bringing blessings once a year..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "蛇神",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Serpent God"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "つい先日我にその役が回ってきたと思ったら、\nもう馬神への交代時期だという。早すぎるではないか！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I thought my turn had just come, but now they say it's time to hand over to the Horse God. It's far too soon!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "蛇神",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Serpent God"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんな理由かいっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's your reason?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんて人騒がせな神だ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What a troublesome deity..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "蛇神よ。そこにいましたか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Serpent God. There you are."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "馬神",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Horse God"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "！？\u3000今度はなに！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "!? Now what?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたの役目は終わったのです。\n大人しく社に戻りなさい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your role has ended. Return to the shrine quietly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "馬神",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Horse God"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "馬神か……断る！\u3000我はまだ、楽しむのだ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Horse God... I refuse! I will continue to enjoy myself!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "蛇神",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Serpent God"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ま、またあああ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A-again?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "って、あれ？\u3000特になんともない……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, huh? Nothing's happening...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "御前試合と先ほどの祈祷で、\nだいぶ力が抑えられているようですが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The exhibition match and my prayers seem to have suppressed much of its power..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まだまだ満足させる必要があるってこと？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So we still need to satisfy it more?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そのようだな。お前の力でなんとかならんのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It would seem so. Can't you do something about this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こればかりはなんとも……迷惑をかけますが、\n引き続き相手をしていただけないでしょうか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm afraid not... I apologize for the inconvenience, but could you continue keeping it entertained?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "馬神",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Horse God"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふむ。害意は無いのであろう？\n余興と思えばこれもまたよし！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm. It bears no ill will, does it? If we think of it as entertainment, so be it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "前向きだなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're awfully optimistic about this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]